{"id":"n15402-1-10","stage":5,"title":"공평하다 · 公平","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15402-1-10-1","ko":"이 대회에는 회원들만 참가할 수 있어요?","zh":"这次比赛只有会员才能参加吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대회에는","meaning":"比赛，大赛","explanation":"대회：比赛，大赛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"대회","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61306","senseId":"2","lemma":"대회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회원들만","meaning":"会员","explanation":"회원：会员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"회원","audio":"/audio/e335b89934ea6dc40371.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73243","senseId":"1","lemma":"회원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참가할","meaning":"参加，参与","explanation":"참가하다：参加，参与；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"참가하다","audio":"/audio/2d7ab58e250bd42261f5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71788","senseId":"1","lemma":"참가하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"7255709b1fec18f4","term":"대회","zh":"比赛，大赛","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3","entryId":"61306","definition":"许多人较量实力或技术的活动。","pronunciation":["대ː회","대ː훼"]},{"id":"e335b89934ea6dc4","term":"회원","zh":"会员","audio":"/audio/e335b89934ea6dc40371.mp3","entryId":"73243","definition":"组成某个组织的人。","pronunciation":["회ː원","훼ː원"]},{"id":"2d7ab58e250bd422","term":"참가하다","zh":"参加，参与","audio":"/audio/2d7ab58e250bd42261f5.mp3","entryId":"71788","definition":"去聚会、团体、比赛或活动等场合共同进行。","pronunciation":["참가하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c1f47c61504e5d2cc6a3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15402-1-10-2","ko":"아니요. 참가 기회는 공평하니까 누구나 와도 돼요.","zh":"不是的。参赛机会是公平的，任何人都可以来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참가","meaning":"参加，参与","explanation":"참가：参加，参与","readings":[{"term":"참가","audio":"/audio/78d338afc294d4e6c510.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24818","senseId":"1","lemma":"참가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기회는","meaning":"机会，机遇，时机","explanation":"기회：机会，机遇，时机；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"기회","audio":"/audio/1815f64fee30a098d49f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73494","senseId":"1","lemma":"기회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공평하니까","meaning":"公平","explanation":"공평하다：公平；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"공평하다","audio":"/audio/e90b2db66a023c44398c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15402","senseId":"1","lemma":"공평하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누구나","meaning":"谁都，无论是谁","explanation":"누구：谁都，无论是谁；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"2","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와도","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"78d338afc294d4e6","term":"참가","zh":"参加，参与","audio":"/audio/78d338afc294d4e6c510.mp3","entryId":"24818","definition":"去聚会、团体、比赛或活动等场合共同进行。","pronunciation":["참가"]},{"id":"1815f64fee30a098","term":"기회","zh":"机会，机遇，时机","audio":"/audio/1815f64fee30a098d49f.mp3","entryId":"73494","definition":"适合做某事的时期或状况。","pronunciation":["기회","기훼"]},{"id":"e90b2db66a023c44","term":"공평하다","zh":"公平","audio":"/audio/e90b2db66a023c44398c.mp3","entryId":"15402","definition":"不偏向一方，同等对大家。","pronunciation":["공평하다"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁都，无论是谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指尚未确定的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fcc24955190d061ab4b8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.514,"source":{"url":"